            {
                "entry_id": "c2e36284-13f2-3700-a931-210ae7a41db7",
                "word": "copulation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "54bd0bc0-d0cd-4cd5-bc3a-dcf6bbe205df",
                        "entry_id": "c2e36284-13f2-3700-a931-210ae7a41db7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "copulations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "15b58fd4-c4f9-370d-ac01-b218d24e7bb2",
                        "entry_id": "c2e36284-13f2-3700-a931-210ae7a41db7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Accouplement au cours duquel le mâle introduit directement le sperme dans les voies génitales de la femelle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ecd03fe6-6c67-4d69-a25d-f6e1c3ccd6bf",
                                "sense_id": "15b58fd4-c4f9-370d-ac01-b218d24e7bb2",
                                "text": "La copulation qui ne se produit qu’à une période bien limitée du cycle annuel du Manchot est évidemment sous la dépendance d’une motivation endocrinienne."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2fb22ae8-3b44-30e6-b1d2-aed5ed7ccd4f",
                        "entry_id": "c2e36284-13f2-3700-a931-210ae7a41db7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Conjonction de l’homme et de la femme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c76c2f3d-98b3-4d0c-afc4-33d190beb394",
                                "sense_id": "2fb22ae8-3b44-30e6-b1d2-aed5ed7ccd4f",
                                "text": "J’en savais long désormais sur les appétits amoureux de l’Empereur. Je savais qu’il préférait de beaucoup l’irrumation à la fellation, et l’irrumation à la copulation proprement dite."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a2717242-894f-4b8f-8ee6-afddd0081642",
                        "source_entry_id": "c2e36284-13f2-3700-a931-210ae7a41db7",
                        "target_lang_word": "copulation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "copulation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d7d6ab7-263a-3aa7-8eb7-e8910f7a008c",
                                        "entry_id": "2a97506f-43b1-31f3-bcb4-cfc8335fc951",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of coupling or joining; union; conjunction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f200a027-bace-429f-ae69-c43b41e2723f",
                                                "sense_id": "7d7d6ab7-263a-3aa7-8eb7-e8910f7a008c",
                                                "text": "I quite correctly defined logical copulation by means [of] the copula of inclusion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc524b32-c2d4-3b35-9765-4325f417ed6a",
                                        "entry_id": "2a97506f-43b1-31f3-bcb4-cfc8335fc951",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexual procreation between a man and a woman or transfer of the sperm from male to female; usually applied to the mating process in nonhuman animals; coitus; coition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5726221-3c5f-46d9-affe-463f2d54e87e",
                                                "sense_id": "dc524b32-c2d4-3b35-9765-4325f417ed6a",
                                                "text": "Solomon, who was one of the Deity's favorities, had a copulation cabinet composed of seven hundred wives and three hundred concubines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20de11ef-f0df-458d-8f69-58f69a1b2daa",
                                                "sense_id": "dc524b32-c2d4-3b35-9765-4325f417ed6a",
                                                "text": "In the dusky streets around me ruled an innocent and open copulation. The entire town mated together, in the leafy bowers that had sprung up among the washing-machines and television sets in the shopping mall, on the settees and divans by the furniture store, in the tropical paradises of the suburban gardens."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
